# methods paper: paper-specific drafts, handoffs, competitor research, and
# benchmark scripts that hardcode local dataset paths — kept on disk, not public.
# Reusable code lives in src/fluorostats/; a self-contained figure demo lives in
# examples/publication_figure/ (curated, self-contained assets).
methods_paper/

# local raw microscopy data folders (also covered by *.oib)
Hydrogel permability/
Extrusion paper data Dextran/

# regenerable example / benchmark outputs (scripts recreate these on run).
# NB: benchmarks/results/ is bundled INPUT data (tracked); only figures/ output
# and downloaded raw data under benchmarks/ are regenerable and ignored.
examples/**/figures/
examples/publication_figure/results/
benchmarks/figures/
benchmarks/data/
